Scope of this licence

The MIT terms above cover the source code, scripts and documentation authored
for this project (README-SOUTHPOLE.md explains the design intent and is
reference material, not flight software).

The NASA/NAIF SPICE kernels, LRO LOLA polar DEMs and any other data fetched by
scripts/fetch_data.py are NOT covered by this file. They are United States
public-domain works (NASA PDS / NAIF) and remain so; see data/SOURCES.md for
provenance and SHA-256 digests.

The vendored Three.js source under app/vendor/three/ keeps its own MIT licence,
reproduced in app/vendor/three/LICENSE.
